    "title": "Crowley leading Tiffany in first Marquette head-to-head poll of governor's race - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anya van Wagtendonk ,\n10 hours ago A new poll matching up the two candidates for Wisconsin governor shows Democrat David Crowley leading Republican Tom Tiffany by five points among likely voters. But the Crowley advantage shrinks when polling all registered voters, according to the first Marquette Law School poll since Crowley and Tiffany emerged from the Aug. 11 primary. Read full article",
